ong",{},"Settings » API",".",[201,223,224],{},"Vatly provides separate API keys for live and test environments:",[226,227,228,239],"ul",{},[229,230,231,234,235,238],"li",{},[218,232,233],{},"Live keys"," are prefixed with ",[205,236,237],{},"live_"," and are used for production requests.",[229,240,241,234,244,247],{},[218,242,243],{},"Test keys",[205,245,246],{},"test_"," and are used for testing and development.",[249,250,251],"note",{},"Use your test API key during development to avoid affecting live data. Switch to your live API key when you're ready to go to production.",[201,253,254],{},"Here's how to authenticate your requests using cURL:",[256,257,262],"pre",{"className":258,"code":259,"filename":260,"language":261,"meta":109,"style":109},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","curl https://api.vatly.com/v1/checkouts \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer live_your_api_key_here\"\n","Example request with API key","bash",[205,263,264,281],{"__ignoreMap":109},[265,266,269,273,277],"span",{"class":267,"line":268},"line",1,[265,270,272],{"class":271},"sBMFI","curl",[265,274,276],{"class":275},"sfazB"," https://api.vatly.com/v1/checkouts",[265,278,280],{"class":279},"sTEyZ"," \\\n",[265,282,284,287,291,294],{"class":267,"line":283},2,[265,285,286],{"class":275},"  -H",[265,288,290],{"class":289},"sMK4o"," \"",[265,292,293],{"class":275},"Authorization: Bearer live_your_api_key_here",[265,295,296],{"class":289},"\"\n",[201,298,299],{},"Always keep your API key safe and never expose it in client-side code or commit it to version control. If you suspect your API key has been compromised, you can regenerate it from the Vatly dashboard.",[196,301,303],{"id":302},"using-an-sdk","Using an SDK",[201,305,306],{},"If you use one of our official SDKs, authentication is straightforward. Simply provide your API key when initializing the client, and the SDK will handle the rest.",[256,308,313],{"className":309,"code":310,"fil